odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part2-packages.txt:478:2.3.2 OpenDocument Package Extended Producer
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part2-packages.txt:480:An OpenDocument Package Extended Producer is a program that creates conforming OpenDocument extended packages. It shall be accompanied by a document that defines all implementation-defined values used by the OpenDocument package producer.
